{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_st03","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_09_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-ST-3","storyName":"须问汤","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在很久以前，岁陵中诞生出第十二个新生的意识。这缕懵懂的意识与古老而庞大的存在对谈，关于这浩大的人间，他有许多疑问。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_st03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"characters":["大理寺官员","虞澄","麟青砚","睚","“老天师”","槐琥","老鲤","疯癫的喃语","魏彦吾","影卫","陈","余"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bigcaveamb","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"big","id":6},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"big","fadetime":"2","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cavewaterdrop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"ca","id":8},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"ca","fadetime":"2","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"......今夕何夕？","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"幽暗的陵墓不见天日，在这片混沌黑暗中，仿佛时间都已静止。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"距离这里上一次传来动静已经过去多久？","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"而这一天，这里多出了一道声音。","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gintcrturnhle","volume":"1","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这是哪里......？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":17},{"type":"subtitle","text":"陵墓。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":18},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我是谁？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":19},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不知。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":20},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......你是谁？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":21},{"type":"subtitle","text":"也不知。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":22},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不过......他们给我起过一个名字。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":23},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“岁”。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":24},{"type":"subtitle","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":26},{"type":"image","image":"58_i15_1","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":27},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gintcrturbrth","volume":"1","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"text","text":"你留在这里，很久了吗？","id":31},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ca","fadetime":"2","id":33},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"big","fadetime":"2","id":34},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"image","id":37},{"type":"charslot","id":38},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":39},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ouat_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":40,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fetterfts","volume":"1","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1630_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员","text":"虞先生，上车吧。","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"在下还有个不情之请。","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"这位兄弟，行个方便。帮我去那马路对面的小饭馆，买碗白饭，讨杯茶水。","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"要入大狱，也不好空着肚子去。","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1630_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员","text":"分内的事，您稍等。","id":55},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":57},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"要走了？","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"判决已下，总不好一直赖在大理寺。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我知道......今日专程，来送送您。","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"你倒是不怨我。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#4$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"既然已经知晓事情全貌，又何怨之有？","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"要怨，也只能怨您没有早些告诉我。","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"若我早些告诉你，恐怕现在你也得戴上这副镣铐。","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"总要为大理寺留下几个好苗子......","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#2$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"对前辈的定罪，我也提出过异议。","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"其实，前辈若是觉得量刑不公，大可申请三法司复审——","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"难道你觉得，我的所作所为，担不起这十年牢狱？","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#2$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"可您做的这一切，终究是为了......","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#6$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"那又如何？","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"法就是法，不是“道义”。","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"今日的虞澄若不服法，将来又会有多少个虞澄，为了他们各自的“道义”，造出多少乱事？","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#5$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"还说这样的蠢话，不像我带出来的徒弟。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#4$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"晚辈失言......","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"当然，要如何让这个“法”，接近更多人心中的道义，那就是你们后来人的事了。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#3$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我会等着......山上的那棵松树还在，我还等着到时候，你把它砍下来给我做棺材。","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#11$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"说起来，你今日来给我送行，为何不穿大理寺的官服？","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#4$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我辞官了。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"一道惊雷，能照亮眼前一瞬，但它断不清世上一切是非黑白与真假善恶。我看不清的事还有很多。","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"山上的那棵青松还在，但到底也只是一棵青松而已。登山人在这棵青松上看到了什么，还要看登山人自己的心。","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我会回天师府，再修行一段时间。","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......也好。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"想不明白的事，稀里糊涂地做下去，总归做不出名堂。","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#2$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"前辈......我最后，还有一事不解。","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"您究竟为何......执意要查太师的案子？","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#1$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......为什么这么问？","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我整理了这件案子的前后资料，才发现，为这案子付出一切的，不止顾筌一人。","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"顾筌如此尚有动机，可您除了当年奉命厘清大理寺未解决的旧案，与这件案子并无直接关联。","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#2$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1630_1#1$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员","text":"虞先生，给您打的饭。","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员","text":"余味居的跑堂，说什么也不肯收钱，还说随时等着您再到店里去做客。","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员","text":"奇怪，我也没说是给您打的饭呀......","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#2$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我想起几十年前，我第一次在饭馆里遇见顾筌的时候，他跟我说什么“五色令人目盲，五味令人口爽”......","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#9$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"我后来才想明白，到底还是因为我这人目光短浅，舌头粗钝。","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"眼中只能见得清白真相，嘴里只咽得下清白滋味。","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"身穿囚服的男人回过头，望向了大理寺的门匾，望向了藏在门后的决院。","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"他躬下身，掬起柏树下一抔未化的残雪，撒入碗中，三两口扒完了饭。","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1617_1#10$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"好滋味。","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虞澄","text":"......且去也。","id":134},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenstairfts","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":136},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"2","id":137},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carriage_loop","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"ca","id":140},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ca","fadetime":"4","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"background","id":145},{"type":"image","image":"58_i15_2","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.7","yScale":"1.7","y":"200","fadetime":"0","id":146},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"-320","xTo":"-420","duration":"20","block":"false","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cavewaterdrop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"ca","id":148},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"ca","fadetime":"2","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你为什么会留在这里？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":153},{"type":"subtitle","text":"因为我犯下的一个错误......一次疏忽......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":154},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我可以感受到，你很痛苦，你很愤怒......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":155},{"type":"subtitle","text":"但过去了很久，你的伤口在愈合，你的愤怒也在平息。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":156},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......你听上去很疲惫？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":157},{"type":"subtitle","id":158},{"type":"image","image":"58_i15_1","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.7","yScale":"1.7","y":"-150","fadetime":"4","id":159},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"380","xTo":"445","duration":"20","block":"false","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":161},{"type":"subtitle","text":"是......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":162},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我的意识，我的灵魂，都已经分化为许多部分。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":163},{"type":"subtitle","text":"就像你一样......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":164},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他们都去哪了？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":165},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这座陵墓外，名为“人间”的地方。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":166},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“人间”......那里是个很美的地方吗？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":167},{"type":"subtitle","text":"并不是......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":168},{"type":"subtitle","text":"在那里，我见过最凶残的屠戮，最狠毒的阴谋，最残忍的背叛！","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":169},{"type":"subtitle","text":"至亲相残，至爱成仇......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":170},{"type":"subtitle","text":"傲慢造就了我的失败，因为我不懂“人心”。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":171},{"type":"subtitle","text":"既然你说，人间是如此险恶、丑陋的地方......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":172},{"type":"subtitle","text":"那为什么，他们还要去呢？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":173},{"type":"subtitle","text":"因为......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":174},{"type":"subtitle","id":175},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ca","fadetime":"4","id":176},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"4","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"image","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_bg_35_g11_yumendesert.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":184},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fssand","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#6$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"什么人？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act23side/m_sys_act23side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":192,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#10$1","duration":"1.5","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#10$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"哟，走了这么远了，还准备上哪去？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#6$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"......与你何干？","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#5$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"你在大炎的地界上撒泼耍浑，还想让我当看不见？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"你们这些老东西，我看是伤疤没好就忘了痛。我们当年能把你们揍一顿，从这片土地上赶出去，现在照样能。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"就凭你一人？可笑......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sand_transition","layer":"1","id":206},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":207},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandwnd","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"s","id":208},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"s","fadetime":"2","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sand02","flip":"1","layer":"2","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#1$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"哦，想打架？行啊。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"fire","id":216},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":217},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0.92","g":"0.4","b":"0.3","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":219},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fire","fadetime":"6","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"我知道你肚子里装下了几片小天地，我倒要看看你和那个画画的谁的本事更大。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#5$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"残山剩水，经得住我几把火？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#6$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"你会为你的挑衅付出代价。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#5$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"哼......","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":229},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#3$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"算了，就算在这宰了你，你还是能原样再捏一个出来，没什么意思。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"如果你在找一个退缩的理由，我可以接受。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#2$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"懒得和你掰扯，在我找到你的本体，彻底干掉你之前，我还想问你一个问题。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"我就是很好奇，那个臭棋篓子到底许了什么好处，让你心甘情愿听他使唤？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"不对......应该说，“你们”。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#1$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"他的谋划与我无关，我们不过是有些共同目的。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#6$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"我要找的，是那个被囚禁在陵墓里的，可耻的叛徒。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#2$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"你要是真心想报仇，早就该将祂那些个分身一一杀了，然后等着祂死在和大炎的战争里。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"这么多年过去了，你所谓的“同族”，这片大地上也不剩几只了吧......你到底还是念旧的。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#4$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"看在这点“人情味”上，倒不能把你们和野兽等同视之了。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#6$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"......荒唐。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#2$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"不......不对，这也不是你和他合谋的全部理由。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1238_1#5$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"别以为能骗过我，这么多年来，炎国一直留着几双眼睛在盯着你们。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“老天师”","text":"你们还惦记着，百灶城下的那个东西......","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1238_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_786_1#5$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睚","text":"......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":259},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"s","fadetime":"2","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"bgeffect","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_bg_bg_caveentrance2_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_243_waaifu_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_243_waaifu_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"鲤叔......","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"阿爸他......会在这里吗？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"跟着能打听到的消息，只能找到这里来了。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"唉......和他分别这么多年来，我倒头一回希望关于他的传闻是假的。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"可是那个传闻中打遍武林，甚至多次故意伤人的武疯子，也实在没法想象会有第二个人了......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_243_waaifu_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"阿爸，为什么会变成那样......","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"不知道......","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"他是这世上第一等的痴人，可越是痴人，心智越不该被动摇的。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"0.3","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":289},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","volume":"0.5","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_243_waaifu_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"这个声音？！","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"——！","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"槐琥......一会见到他，千万要小心。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"或许现在只有你能叫醒他。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_243_waaifu_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"嗯......","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"鲤叔......我们走吧。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"唉......","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"（难道那把剑，真的是劫数......？）","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老鲤","text":"（梁洵啊梁洵......要是槐天裴有个三长两短，这笔账就只能记在你的头上了。）","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_322_lmlee_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"charslot","id":315},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_bg_bg_cave_5.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"隔着尚远的一段距离，山洞深处，隐约可见一个魁梧的身影。","id":319},{"type":"text","text":"沉重的拳头不住地砸在岩壁上，在上面留下了点点梅花似的血斑。每一拳落下，都震得整座洞穴摇摇晃晃。","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"来人这才意识到，这个“山洞”，竟是被此人一拳一拳打出来的。","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疯癫的喃语","text":"四十年......天下第一......我何时......","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"1","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":325},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.3","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":326},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":327},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"2","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疯癫的喃语","text":"剑......不可给人......丢了......还是丢了！","id":330},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp5","volume":"1","id":332},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sandfall_01","layer":"1","id":333},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":334},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":335},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"3","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疯癫的喃语","text":"女儿......不许伤害我的女儿！","id":339},{"type":"dialog","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":341},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_243_waaifu_1#2$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"阿爸......？","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"阿爸......醒一醒......","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_243_waaifu_1#6$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"槐琥","text":"阿爸！","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_243_waaifu_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"charslot","id":352},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_2005_weiyw_1#5","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"差不多能看到百灶了。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"这座驿馆，竟也算故地重游。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"......怎么，你们坚持要陪我一同过来，现在却一言不发？","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_038","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"影卫","text":"在这里死去的，皆是我们的兄弟。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_038.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_2005_weiyw_1#5","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"也皆是为了“忠义”......","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_038","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"影卫","text":"魏公，有人跟随。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_038.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_2005_weiyw_1#2","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"嗯......","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_038","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"影卫","text":"当心——","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_038.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.05","duration":"0.2","id":375},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.2","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"background","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":382},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.8","id":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","volume":"0.9","delay":"0.2","id":384},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spear","volume":"0.8","id":388},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","volume":"0.9","delay":"0.2","id":389},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":390},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_038","afrom":"0","ato":"0","duration":"0","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1","duration":"2","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_038","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"影卫","text":"好剑法......","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_038.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"影卫","text":"多年不见，你的剑法与当年已不可同日而语。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_038.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"影卫","text":"......陈家小姐。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_038.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_790_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"好久不见......魏彦吾......舅舅。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_2005_weiyw_1#5","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"晖洁......","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_790_1#1$1","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"我本以为在龙门做的事，就是你能做出的最愚蠢的决定......","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"你，还有你带着的这些人......现在又打算如何？","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_2005_weiyw_1#5","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"......你不该在这里。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"难道是文月......告诉了你？","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_790_1#2$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"这是我自己的决定，与他人无关。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_2005_weiyw_1#5","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"这件事同样与你无关——","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_790_1#2$1","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......的确。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_790_1#1$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"我从来没有问过你过去的事，我想那是你的私事，我也无权干涉。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"这几年我又去过了许多地方，见过不少没见过、没想过的事。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"我也想明白了，这世上万般矛盾，总有一个“公义”可言。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"母亲的事......姐姐的事......不能说与你的过往无关。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_2005_weiyw_1#4","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魏彦吾","text":"......","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_char_2005_weiyw_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_790_1#1$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"所以我想亲眼看看，这段纠缠了你一辈子的往事，究竟要怎样收场。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_790_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":438},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":439},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":440},{"type":"charslot","id":441},{"type":"image","image":"58_i15_1","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"0","id":442},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"40","block":"false","id":443},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gintcrturbrth","volume":"1","id":444},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":445},{"type":"playmusic","volume":"0.6","id":446,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我似乎想起了许多事。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":450},{"type":"subtitle","text":"在这具庞大的躯体内，通过这双穿过雾霭的双眼，曾看到的。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":451},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你原本就是这具神识的一部分，也理所当然拥有这些记忆。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":452},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可是......我看到的人间，与你所说的，并不一致。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":453},{"type":"subtitle","text":"那你看到的又是什么？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":454},{"type":"subtitle","text":"一团火。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":455},{"type":"subtitle","text":"在最初的最初，人们团聚在一起，为了抵抗凶猛的野兽，为了照明冰冷寒夜，点起的一团火。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":456},{"type":"subtitle","text":"人们围着这团火，铸造出各式各样的工具，烹制出各式各样的菜肴。他们的脸上有许多种我无法理解的表情......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":457},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我很想知道，那是什么样的感觉？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":458},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这样的念头，很危险......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":459},{"type":"subtitle","text":"危险？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":460},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你的同类，那些已经行走在人间的分身，他们都怀揣着相似的念头走入人间，可等着他们的，也只有无尽的折磨。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":461},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他们......都想要成为人？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":462},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可是在成为人之前，我想先想明白......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":463},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“什么是人？”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":464},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我该到哪里去寻找答案......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":465},{"type":"subtitle","text":"呵......去吧。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":466},{"type":"subtitle","text":"去“人间”走一遭。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":467},{"type":"subtitle","text":"七情六欲，爱恨嗔贪，都会带来无尽的苦痛。一念既起，便如混沌开窍。一旦牵绊其中，便永远不可挣脱。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":468},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......你不害怕？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":469},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":470},{"type":"subtitle","id":471},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":472},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gintcrturvive","volume":"1","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":474},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smkedspte","volume":"1","id":475},{"type":"image","image":"58_i15_2","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","id":476},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":477},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":478},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":479},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":480},{"type":"charslot","id":481},{"type":"image","id":482},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":483},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":484},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":485},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#16$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"啊——！","id":488},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"呼......原来是梦啊......","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"不过会梦到祂也不奇怪就是了......","id":491},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$1","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"人呢......","id":493},{"type":"charslot","id":494},{"type":"text","text":"小大厨从躺椅上跳下来，使劲伸了个懒腰，又努力揉了揉眼睛。","id":495},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的厨房还是原来的模样，锅碗瓢盆皆在原处。","id":496},{"type":"text","text":"忽然间，他像是想起了什么，匆忙打开橱柜，抱出一堆装着油盐酱醋的瓶子。","id":497},{"type":"text","text":"他小心翼翼地依次将每一味调料送入口中，眉头紧锁，仔细思索。","id":498},{"type":"text","text":"过了许久，笑容才在他脸上浮现。","id":499},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"还好......还好......","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"还是一样的滋味......","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"是人是兽，记不记得，好像也没差嘛。","id":503},{"type":"dialog","id":504},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_livelyrestaurant","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"li","id":505},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"li","fadetime":"2","id":506},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":507},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":508},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#7$1","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"世味悠悠，这一路要找的滋味也都算找到了，再往后的事啊......不想了不想了！","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"今朝有味今朝醉，明日愁来明日愁......也没什么大不了的。","id":511},{"type":"dialog","id":512},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":513},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":514},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"先开张吧。","id":516},{"type":"dialog","id":517},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":518},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":519},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"li","fadetime":"2","id":520},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":521},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":522},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":523},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":524},{"type":"charslot","id":525},{"type":"background","id":526},{"type":"image","id":527}],"characters":["大理寺官员","虞澄","麟青砚","睚","“老天师”","槐琥","老鲤","疯癫的喃语","魏彦吾","影卫","陈","余"]}